%% M6 required real-time tracking sequence: courier update to browser.
%% Editable source for sequence-m6-status-event-to-live-update.svg / .png.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Courier
    participant P as parcel-service
    participant K as Kafka
    participant T as tracking-service
    participant M as MongoDB tracking
    participant S as Socket.IO gateway
    actor B as Browser or dispatcher
    C->>P: PATCH /courier/parcels/{id}/status OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
    P->>P: one transaction parcel, history, outbox row
    P-->>C: 200 OK
    P->>K: outbox relay publishes ParcelStatusChanged, key parcelId
    K->>T: deliver to group tracking-service
    alt first delivery of eventId
        T->>M: insert processed_event, unique eventId and consumer
        M-->>T: ok
        T->>M: upsert timeline, append event, currentStatus, publicView
        M-->>T: timeline updated
        T->>S: emit parcel.status to tracking:no, user:sub, dispatch
        S-->>B: parcel.status, masked view, no PII
    else duplicate eventId
        M-->>T: already processed, no write, no emit
    end
    T-->>K: commit consumer offset
    Note over S: Redis adapter forwards the emit to every replica
